      "blurb": "Elcor ambassador and inter-species negotiator",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Elcor diplomats move with slow deliberation, each word prefaced with an emotional qualifier that other species find perplexing at first and reassuring in time. They are patient, thorough, and deeply committed to due process. Though rarely aggressive, their massive frames and quadrupedal gait make them imposing presences in any negotiating chamber.</p><p><strong>Emotional Prefix:</strong> Elcor communication is always preceded by an emotional qualifier (e.g., \"With sincere regret: I must decline.\"). Observers who understand this gain a +1 circumstance bonus on Perception checks to determine the elcor's emotional state.</p>",
